{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Concurrency defect milestone\n\nConfirmed a product defect under the project concurrency contract. Parallel ref-updating fetches can race on one Git common directory. Controlled tracker-sync execution produced 82 stale-reference comparison failures in 128 parallel attempts and zero in 128 serialized attempts. A cross-path experiment produced nine snapshot aborts in twelve attempts and 113 sync failures in 132 calls, with zero failures in the serialized control. Fresh local repositories excluded network, credentials, missing objects, and tracker state.\n\nCreated priority two bug `agrologic-oval-bobolink`, ID `ccd2-528c-b4a9-4b90`. The ticket records the source paths, historical constraints, proof, and binary acceptance criteria. It is linked `discovered_from` `cepivorous-dynamitic-deer` and `relates_to` `icicled-unstable-urial`, `chordal-quasilegal-pipit`, `eclectic-spotted-barb`, `honest-repulsive-blackfish`, `chilly-hyena-jet`, and `scorpioid-important-thylacine`.\n\nAttribution followed the current Python line through the Tier D carrier to commit `c5d79b58b6e829b336684c46cfc482c17c111c7a`, which introduced fetch outside the write lock. Searches by full SHA, policy text, `WS3`, and `REMEDIATION_PROPOSAL.md` found no origin ticket. The bug records a pre-ticket attribution and no `caused_by` edge. The explicit tickets refspec remains a required narrow-clone fix and is excluded as a workaround. No concurrency repair was implemented.\n\nF20 is complete. `fleshless-gray-weasel` is closed with its correction appended to `aimless-seclusive-tigershark`. The correction cites `messy-moose-jig` for the historical claim-enforcement decision and `docs/plan-review-gate.md` for current behavior. ADR 0018 is correctly limited to the T5c trust-boundary scope gate."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787520320109459001,"uuid":"4c9bc0ee-d4d1-42cc-84f5-04644aa63154"}